A quick look through the source:

It seems that when you kill a monster that can leave a corpse (and is
not a kop), there is a 1/6 chance that a random extra item is
generated (of any class), and of these, there is a 1/20 chance for it
to be turned into an artifact, if it's a weapon or armor for which an
artifact is available (And there is not randomly generated armor
artifact in vanilla). So if you kill enough black puddings to get 20
long swords, one of them is likely to be an artifact. (Note that this
is independant of the player's alignment, since it's not a gift).

Also, no large items for small monsters (bimanual or bulky, or spear,
polearm or morningstar?). Black puddings are large though.

So, looking at long swords in normal dungeon, 1/6 change of a kill
generating an item, 10% chance of it being a weapon, 5% chance of long
sword, 1/20 chance of artifact.
So you'd need to kill 24000 puddings before you can expect to get a
long-sword artifact?

If you include warhammer, katana, battleaxe, long sword and silver
saber, there's 8.6% chance rather than the 5% above, and probability
is double in gehenom too.

Just how long have you been camping there anyway?

Assuming all your 300 potions come from drops and that you haven't
used any potions, that comes out to 1875 item drops. Let's round to
2000 items. (which means, you'd have killed 12000 black puddings).  So
you should have 200 weapons, of which 10 are long swords. Each had a
5% chance of being an artifact so about a 40% chance of getting one of
the long sword artifacts. Not bad. OTOH, Grayswandir and snickerne are
less common (.6% silve saber, .4% katana) so that comes out to about
1.2 silver sabers and .8 katanas, so you lucked out on the 5% chance
of that being an artifact, I guess. Do you have any other katanas or
silver sabers there?

Only weapons and armor become artifacts, so no PYEC. And the Mitre of
holyness can't be randomly generated either. Likewise Magicbane is an
athame, and Stormbringer is a runesword, which are not randomly
generated to begin with.

So, I guess the list of things that can be randomly dropped is:
Demonbane, Grayswandir, Snickesnee, Sunsword, Cleaver, Giantslayer,
Mjollnir, Vorpal blade, Grimtooth, Orcrist, Sting, Dragonbane, Frost
brand, Fire brand, Ogresmahser, Trollsbane and Werebane. Of which you
have 6 already.

(Note: I'm not sure about the long sword/ katana probabilities, so
please correct them if I'm wrong)

